# Test-only environment switches for the booking-agent-cli pytest suite.
#
# The `booking-agent` CLI never reads these, and none of them is needed for the
# default `uv run pytest -q`. They opt in to extra coverage. The CLI does not load
# this file: export a value in your shell before running pytest, for example
#   BOOKING_AGENT_STAGING_REGISTRY_TEST=1 uv run pytest packages/cli/tests/e2e -q
#
# CLI settings (registry, profile URL, HTTP timeouts, Google Calendar OAuth app) live
# in packages/cli/src/booking_agent/defaults.env; see `booking-agent config show`.

# --- Local UCP checkout server ------------------------------------------------------
# Link network_id the mock UCP checkout puts on the `com.stripe.payments` instrument.
# test_ucp_skill_flow_e2e.py sets its own value; set this only to exercise another id.
# BOOKING_AGENT_UCP_TEST_NETWORK_ID=

# --- Live registry checks (network) -------------------------------------------------
# 1 enables test_staging_registry_integration.py against the public Wix USP registry.
# BOOKING_AGENT_STAGING_REGISTRY_TEST=0
# Comma-separated registry queries to try (default: "haircut,AC repair Yuma").
# BOOKING_AGENT_STAGING_SEARCH_QUERY=haircut
# UCP-native business profile URL to resolve (default: the HVAC test business).
# BOOKING_AGENT_STAGING_UCP_PROFILE_URL=
